      "comment": "Tenoch: Tenoch and the Talking Stick",
      "content": "Tenoch's obsidian-inlaid club, so large that Paimon and the Traveler remark on its size in Echoes of Life, is the \"talking stick\" used to settle disputes by force. The weapon's story is the main source of his legend. Per the weapon page, it was later among the mementos Mavuika gave up for the Contending Fire.",
