        "Heroes of Natlan",
        "Tenoch's heroes"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Tenoch"
      ],
      "comment": "Tenoch: The six heroes of the cataclysm",
      "content": "Tenoch gathered Wanjiru, Menilek, Sanhaj, Burkina, Sundjatta and Tupac, one for each of six tribes. Sundjatta only agreed on condition that the Children of Echoes were not involved. The group met the Abyssal tide at Mare Jivari.",
