    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Mare Jivari",
        "Bakunawa"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Tenoch"
      ],
      "comment": "Tenoch: Death at Mare Jivari",
      "content": "In The Last Survivor of Tenochtzitoc, Citlali tells that the Bakunawa was impossible to kill because its pieces regrew. Sanhaj engraved Tenoch's body with Phlogiston Engraving, Tenoch let the beast devour him, and a miniature Night Kingdom inside it destroyed the monster, shattering it and laying waste to the island. The blast and the later temple built by the Pyro Archons contained it, although some believe it never truly died.",
