    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Tenoch's exile"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Sundjatta"
      ],
      "comment": "Tenoch: Exile and the cost of it",
      "content": "Mavuika says Tenoch was exiled before the cataclysm, an act imposed out of necessity, and that he accepted it as deserved. The Talking Stick text has Sundjatta say he petitioned the Pyro Archon for the expulsion for the tribes' stability.",
