    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "Contending Fire"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Tenoch"
      ],
      "comment": "Tenoch: Memory scene with Mavuika",
      "content": "In a dreamlike memory sequence near the end of Past and Future, where Mavuika meets figures from her past, Tenoch speaks of the Abyss as a cunning enemy he had fought many times. He says his rage would never be absolved and his power would no longer aid Mavuika's victory, yet he accepts her choice, asks her to earn the victory he and the heroes are owed, and ends with \"For Natlan.\"",
